# Copy this to supabase/.env and fill it in. That file is ignored by git — the
# service-account JSON and the AI key must never be committed.
#
# Set them on the project with:
#   supabase secrets set --env-file supabase/.env
#
# Only the push sender needs the FCM pair; only the AI writer needs the AI
# group, and it still answers without a key (it composes the page from the
# seller's own notes and says so).

# --- send-push (supabase/functions/send-push) -------------------------------
# LEFT COMMENTED ON PURPOSE. `supabase secrets set --env-file` writes every
# name in the file, blank ones included, so an uncommented empty pair here
# would clear secrets a working project already has. Add them only when you
# are setting push up; otherwise leave them alone and set the AI key on its
# own, the way the note under the table in supabase/README.md shows.
# The whole Firebase service-account JSON, on ONE line, quoted:
# FCM_SERVICE_ACCOUNT={"project_id":...}
# Any long random string; callers send it in the x-push-secret header:
# PUSH_SHARED_SECRET=

# --- generate-product-description (the AI writer) --------------------------
# The one line a working AI needs. Anything the function already defaults to
# (gpt-4o-mini at api.openai.com) stays commented here, because a name in this
# file is not a suggestion — setting it replaces what the project has.
AI_API_KEY=

# Any OpenAI-compatible provider works instead, and a cheap one is fine: this
# writes a product page, it does not need the biggest model on the shelf.
# Groq has a free tier and finishes a 1500-word page in seconds:
# AI_BASE_URL=https://api.groq.com/openai/v1
# AI_MODEL=llama-3.3-70b-versatile

# How many descriptions one account may ask for in ten minutes. Eight is right
# for a shop and small for whoever is testing a catalogue: AI_RATE_MAX=40 for
# the afternoon, set it back afterwards.
# AI_RATE_MAX=8

# Optional, and the defaults are fine for a 700-1500 word page.
# AI_TEMPERATURE=0.7
# AI_MAX_PASSES=3
# AI_BUDGET_MS=120000
# AI_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_MS=90000
# AI_MAX_TOKENS=2700
